  <p class=3D"lead-intro">I am a Professor of Economics at the University o=
f Oxford.</p>

  <p>I coordinate the <a href=3D"https://maxkasy.github.io/home/ML_Econ_Oxf=
ord/">Machine Learning and Economics Group</a> at Oxford.</p>

    Research:
    <ul>
      <li> Machine learning theory; the social impact of algorithmic decisi=
on making; the political economy of AI  </li>
      <li> Economic inequality; basic income and job guarantee programs </l=
i>=20
      <li> Publication bias, pre-analysis plans, and statistics as a social=
 process</li>=20
      <li> Adaptive experimental design </li>
      <li> Statistical decision theory; Empirical Bayes methods </li>
      <li> Identification and causality </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

<div style=3D"flex: 1;">
